{"t":"VICI","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"VICI Properties Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Diversified","employees":28,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.viciproperties.com","summary_en":"VICI Properties Inc. is a real estate investment trust that owns one of the largest portfolios of market-leading gaming, hospitality, wellness, entertainment and leisure destinations, including Caesars Palace Las Vegas, MGM Grand and the Venetian Resort Las Vegas. VICI Properties owns 103 experiential assets across a geographically diverse portfolio consisting of 63 gaming properties and 40 other experiential properties across the United States and Canada. The portfolio is comprised of approximately 130 million square feet and features approximately 66,000 hotel rooms and over 700 restaurants, bars, nightclubs and sports books. Its properties are occupied by industry-leading gaming, leisure and hospitality operators under long-term, triple-net lease agreements. VICI Properties has a growing array of real estate and financing partnerships with leading operators in other experiential sectors, including Cabot, Cain, Canyon Ranch, Chelsea Piers, Club Med, Great Wolf Resorts, Homefield, Kalahari Resorts and Lucky Strike Entertainment. VICI Properties also owns four championship golf courses and approximately 33 acres of undeveloped and underdeveloped land adjacent to the Las Vegas Strip. VICI Properties Inc. was established on July 05, 2016, and is based in New York, United States. VICI Properties Inc. was incorporated in Maryland.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"VICI Properties Inc.는 Caesars Palace Las Vegas, MGM Grand 및 Venetian Resort Las Vegas를 포함하여 시장을 선도하는 게임, 호텔, 웰니스, 엔터테인먼트 및 레저 목적지로 구성된 최대 포트폴리오 중 하나를 소유한 부동산 투자 신탁 회사입니다. VICI Properties는 미국과 캐나다 전역에서 63개의 게임 자산과 40개의 기타 체험 자산으로 구성된 지리적으로 다양한 포트폴리오에 걸쳐 103개의 체험 자산을 소유하고 있습니다. 포트폴리오는 약 1억 3천만 평방피트로 구성되어 있으며 약 66,000개의 호텔 객실과 700개 이상의 레스토랑, 바, 나이트클럽 및 스포츠 서적을 갖추고 있습니다. 해당 부동산은 장기 삼중 순 임대 계약에 따라 업계를 선도하는 게임, 레저 및 숙박 사업자가 점유하고 있습니다. VICI Properties는 Cabot, Cain, Canyon Ranch, Chelsea Piers, Club Med, Great Wolf Resorts, Homefield, Kalahari Resorts 및 Lucky Strike Entertainment를 비롯한 기타 체험 부문의 주요 운영업체와 점점 더 다양한 부동산 및 금융 파트너십을 맺고 있습니다. VICI Properties는 또한 4개의 챔피언십 골프 코스와 Las Vegas Strip에 인접한 약 33에이커의 미개발 및 저개발 토지를 소유하고 있습니다. VICI Properties Inc.는 2016년 7월 5일에 설립되었으며 미국 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다. VICI Properties Inc.가 메릴랜드에 설립되었습니다.","val":{"price":24.825,"mcap":27334449152.0,"pe":11.493055,"fpe":8.358586,"peg":null,"ps":6.5777383,"pb":0.9421968,"ev_ebitda":14.121,"div":7.38,"beta":0.654,"hi52":30.83,"lo52":22.425},"fin":{"rev":4155599872.0,"rev_g":0.058,"eps_g":-0.563,"gross":0.99275,"op":0.77351,"net":0.56459,"roe":0.08281,"fcf":375747136.0,"cash":270320992.0,"debt":17825748992.0,"de":60.55,"eps":2.16,"feps":2.97},"own":{"short":0.031600002,"inst":0.98296,"insider":0.00283},"analyst":{"n":24,"mean":29.61458,"median":29.5,"high":35.0,"low":24.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.88,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":12,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":12,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":12,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":12,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":30.0,"priorPriceTarget":36.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":29.0,"priorPriceTarget":32.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Stifel","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":30.75,"priorPriceTarget":34.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"mai